    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1. 期中考試&nbsp;30%&nbsp;（無補考）</div>\n\n<div>2.&nbsp;期末考試&nbsp;30%&nbsp;（無補考）</div>\n\n<div>3. 課堂討論參與15%，包含隨堂練習、作業上傳等</div>\n\n<div>4. 實習成績15%</div>\n\n<div>5. 期末分組報告10%，包含書面報告與口頭報告(錄影)</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "1. 準時到課\n                     \n2. 尊重教師和同學\n               \n3. 積極參與",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": "第一週上課請務必到課了解課程須知。\n隨時檢查您的逢甲大學電子郵件和登錄iLearn 清楚本課程所發布之訊息。",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<ul>\n\t<li>作業、考試和報告，不得作弊、抄襲或使用未經授權的資源，應按照要求引用和註明所有使用的資料來源。</li>\n\t<li>學生應尊重他人的觀點，適當地參與討論和合作項目。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>\n<div>若違反上述原則可能會面臨成績扣減、評分降低或成績作廢等處分。<br />\n嚴重的違規行為可能導致學生被列入違規記錄或受到學校紀律委員會的審查。</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Students are required to uphold the fundamental principles of academic integrity, place a strong emphasis on academic ethics, and take active measures to prevent instances of cheating or plagiarism.</div>\n\n<div>In the event that a student is found to have engaged in cheating or plagiarism, the consequences are serious. Examinations and final reports that involve such misconduct will be assigned a grade of zero.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
